   body) instead of the P/Invoke method row 2 — producer record showed
   member_token 0x06000001 + native_implementation_count 2; corrected
   to (2<<1)|1 = 5, count now 1, member RunNative.
5. Oracle-side bugs (not fixture defects): rows start at t+48 (the six
   4-byte counts precede them), GUID index n reads bytes (n-1)*16,
